This example is highly simplified and lacks many features required for a robust production system, such as connection pooling, LRU eviction policy, rate limiting, security measures, and self-healing capabilities. It serves as a starting point for learning about caching strategies and can be expanded with the necessary components to meet the full requirements of the task.']

