// This is a high-level Java-based real-time analytics application for a high-frequency trading platform.
// It processes and visualizes complex market data from multiple sources using WebSocket, HTTP, and Kafka protocols.
// The application handles high-frequency data streams, manages dynamic data formats, ensures secure, authenticated access,
